@title Assign parts to all devices says plainly when no catalog part fits
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
@area Parts
# Network ports have no part of their own. With only ports on the page nothing fits: the dialog has no rows and names the devices. With other devices as well, the dialog lists them and names the ports underneath.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
text "ethernet port"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click 330 150
wait 10
key Escape
key ctrl+k
text "ethernet port"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click 600 150
wait 10
key Escape
key ctrl+k
text "Assign parts to all"
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
expect "Assign parts to all devices"
expect "No part in the catalog fits any of the devices"
expect "Close"
shot nothing-fits
key Escape
wait 8
key ctrl+k
text "ethernet switch"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
click 640 380
wait 10
key Escape
key ctrl+k
text "Assign parts to all"
wait 10
key Return
wait 20
expect "Assign parts to all devices"
expect "No part in the catalog fits"
shot dialog-with-unfit-note
